{"id":"5ef176a8d804d79a","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-back-and-forth.md","title":"Back-and-Forth Method","display":"df-back-and-forth — Back-and-Forth Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-back-and-forth","aliases":["57-df-back-and-forth"],"display":"df-back-and-forth — Back-and-Forth Method","depends_on":["[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-back-and-forth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-back-and-forth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-back-and-forth — Back-and-Forth Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Back-and-Forth-Method\">Back-and-Forth Method</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 是同签名结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a>。本文件保留原单向一步扩展谓词；反向扩展须对逆映射另行调用，不能从其名称推得。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}\">\\(\\mathrm{BackAndForth}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原单向条件本身良定义，不在本定义里换成双向或无限策略条件。修正的是载体与 PartIso 集合来源；相关定理必须另外给出真正的反向和持续扩展条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Back-and-Forth-Method","text":"Back-and-Forth Method","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 是同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。固定 $p\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]。本文件保留原单向一步扩展谓词；反向扩展须对逆映射另行调用，不能从其名称推得。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 是同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。固定 $p\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]。本文件保留原单向一步扩展谓词；反向扩展须对逆映射另行调用，不能从其名称推得。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)).","display":true}],"bytes":1254,"backlinks":[{"id":"983eb8fcfa54aec4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系签名条件，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\mathrm{PartIso}$、原单向 $\\mathrm{BackAndForth}$、$\\equiv$ 见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[57-df-back-and-forth]]、[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]。$\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[57-df-finite]]；$\\mathcal I$ 是按剩余步数分层的部分同构族，$p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}$。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axio